 "_doc": "The work budget of one Deinflect call (README.md, Rules and chaining, Bound). work is the number of units the call spent: a rule is considered for a form only when its from ends in the form's last code point; each such (form, rule) pair costs 1, and its suffix comparison ceil(runes(from)/8) when the class and chainOnly gating let it through; a predicate leaf costs 1 + ceil(scanned/8): minRunes scans min(stem runes, minRunes), notOnly the runes up to and including the first one outside the script (all when none is), a notSuffix entry its own runes. A unit that does not fit stops the call. A candidate longer than the surface plus 64 code points is dropped. A case without budget runs with maxWork; forms are the candidates' forms in output order.",
